["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"## Outcome\n\n`validate --against` a revision without a tree store skips V2 with one line; an `aep.project/3`\ntree store renders `aep.planning-md/2` and an `aep.project/2` store keeps `/1`, with S5 comparing\neach document against the render of its own tag.\n\nDesign: `docs/design/planning-on-entity-runtime-v0.1.md` § 8 and § 13 A5.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- `/2` is the tag change only. § 3.2's `head` key has no defined value and is not written.\n- A `/1` projection of a tree store stays valid until its next write re-renders it; each\n  repository gets one `aep plan artifact render` commit when its planning check moves to the\n  release that renders `/2`.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"create-relation","kind":"decomposes","source":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","target":"ent-b0ac4a7f8e537adc80350c5304614c91"},"changed":{},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"draft","id":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790266732639,"causation":"cmd-child-6f998622a01526281c243d82cf58f4973052e2c50268b2c7d1440fae08e25e69","correlation":"protocol-artifact-relate","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2@1#0~771d45a1e318facd","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-24T16:18:52Z"},"revision":1,"to_state":"draft","type":"aep.relation.create/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790266724349,"id":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/tree-projections-render-planning-md-2","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":1,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790266724349}},"body":"## Outcome\n\n`validate --against` a revision without a tree store skips V2 with one line; an `aep.project/3`\ntree store renders `aep.planning-md/2` and an `aep.project/2` store keeps `/1`, with S5 comparing\neach document against the render of its own tag.\n\nDesign: `docs/design/planning-on-entity-runtime-v0.1.md` § 8 and § 13 A5.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- `/2` is the tag change only. § 3.2's `head` key has no defined value and is not written.\n- A `/1` projection of a tree store stays valid until its next write re-renders it; each\n  repository gets one `aep plan artifact render` commit when its planning check moves to the\n  release that renders `/2`.\n","status":"draft","title":"A tree store renders aep.planning-md/2, and validate skips V2 against a base without one"},"lifecycle_state":"draft"},"extra":null,"model_digest":"","owner":"","refs":null,"relations":null,"scope":null,"summary":"","tags":[],"title":"A tree store renders aep.planning-md/2, and validate skips V2 against a base without one","withholds":""},"expected_revision":2,"kind":"execute","operation":"edit","recording":{"actor":"human:timo","causation":"cmd-child-6f998622a01526281c243d82cf58f4973052e2c50268b2c7d1440fae08e25e69","correlation":"protocol-artifact-relate","record_id":"aep.entity:ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2@1#0~771d45a1e318facd","recorded_at":"2026-09-24T16:18:52Z"},"subject":["story","ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2"]}]